{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Why should the name of our father be diminished.</b> We stand in place of a son, and if females are not counted as seed, let our mother be married to a yavam (Bava Batra 119)." "<b>For he has no son.</b> This means if he had a son, they would claim nothing at all — this teaches that they were wise women (there)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:57.940597989Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}